# Module, layouts, server, rendering

**Agents:** read **`module/<domain>/README.md`** first for the domain you edit. Workflow: **`.cursor/rules/agent-workflow.mdc`**. Platform contracts below — do not duplicate module runbooks in `docs/`.

Read **docs/ui-ux-skills.md**, **docs/naming.md**, **docs/architecture-gaps.md**, **docs/new-feature-checklist.md**, **docs/data-workflow.md**, **docs/layouts.md**, **docs/app-states.md**, **docs/rendering.md**, **docs/server-api.md**, **docs/modules.md**, **docs/packages.md**.

## Naming

- **`<layer>.<slug>.<role>.<ext>`** — see [naming.md](../docs/naming.md); Cursor rule **naming.mdc** on `module/**`.

## Data

- **ServiceResponse** on every controller: `success` \| `failed` \| `error`; validate in `module/shared/utils`; UI toast + body ([data-workflow.md](../docs/data-workflow.md)).

## Actions & audit

- Registry IDs in `packages/actions`; **`runAction`** wraps permission + audit (all outcomes) + handler ([actions-and-events.md](../docs/actions-and-events.md)).

## Routes & layouts

- Read **docs/layouts.md** and **.cursor/rules/layouts.mdc** when editing `app/**/layout.tsx` or module `client/…/layout/`.

## Rendering & states

- Logic in functions; components render props; client islands via `dynamic()` + skeleton.
- Route `loading/error/not-found/forbidden` + in-page ServiceResponse phases — tier-stable skeletons ([app-states.md](../docs/app-states.md)).
- **UI work:** read [ui-ux-skills.md](../docs/ui-ux-skills.md) and relevant `.agents/skills/*/SKILL.md` before editing `client/` or `packages/ui`.

## Server

- All API logic in `module/…/server/`; oRPC only for new RPC.

## Packages

- Platform only.
